From: Kostiantyn Andriiuk <konstantin@andriyuk.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add native-source video recording and paced preview

Cumulative change from the one-shot autofocus build to the tested r15 source.
Includes the intermediate preview, full-resolution still and tap-refocus
changes required by that source tree, without replaying superseded experiments.

